/Content/Ashes/Materials/Instances/MI_RockCollection04_*
/Content/Ashes/Materials/Instances/MI_RockPackVol01_*
/Content/Ashes/Materials/Instances/MI_StreetProps_*
/Content/Ashes/Materials/Instances/MI_MilitaryRadio_*
/Content/Ashes/Materials/Instances/MI_LadderSet_*

# Third-party sample content packs, ~6.1 GB, none of it tracked. This repo has no LFS, so a
# stray `git add .` would try to commit all of it. LV_Soul_Slum lives under SoulCity and is
# rebuilt by Scripts/CompleteSoulCity.py from Saved/MapBackups/LV_Soul_Slum.umap.
/Content/SoulCity/
/Content/PostApocalypticSandbox/
/Content/SciFiWorld/
/Content/Whisper/
/Content/NW_MuzzleFX/
